{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Trapped in an apartment building with neighbors that turn into monsters...</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When some shocking <strong>murders</strong> happen in Corinne's apartment complex, the entire building gets teleported to a <strong>hell dimension.</strong> Corinne needs to escape before she and the other residents start losing their humanity and transforming into <strong>monsters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812700/extras/a6e6d09451c65be8ce187a849ff2d1be.avif?t=1763416794\" width=130 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stay human, Corinne needs to\u00a0<i>talk to others,</i> something she\u00a0<i>really</i> isn't good at. She'd rather just stay inside her apartment, where it's safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812700/extras/d1d07e69643861dac158019718f31105.avif?t=1763416794\" width=144 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But to survive, she'll need to <strong>escape</strong> from monsters, <strong>crawl</strong> into vents, <strong>dig</strong> into the rotten and frozen underbelly of the building, <strong>decipher</strong> cursed artifacts, and even <strong>travel through time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812700/extras/ce8efb1dd6a31fbb9f697ab722a1bcda.avif?t=1763416794\" width=200 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by horror games such as <strong>Ib</strong> and <strong>Pathologic,</strong> emotional survival takes a central focus in <strong>Corinne.</strong> Having the biggest gun is less important than deciding whether you'd pull the trigger <strong>if your best friend becomes a monster.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812700/extras/cf7669d1dbb23ed064a56b13092b6ce7.avif?t=1763416794\" width=154 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Corinne and the other residents make it out alive? That's entirely up to <strong>you</strong> and your ability to guide Corinne safely through this <strong>world of horrors.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812700?t=1763416794","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812700?t=1763416794","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812700/df8a2e5f469ec408d71886e1e1e44b04c8e36fa9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763416794","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812700/df8a2e5f469ec408d71886e1e1e44b04c8e36fa9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763416794","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains many situations that may be uncomfortable for players, including stressful situations, depression, recreational drug use, cursing, pixel-art depictions of violence, references to physical abuse and suicide, and exactly 1 jumpscare."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4180690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Trapped in an apartment building with neighbors that turn into monsters...</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When some shocking <strong>murders</strong> happen in Corinne's apartment complex, the entire building gets teleported to a <strong>hell dimension.</strong> Corinne needs to escape before she and the other residents start losing their humanity and transforming into <strong>monsters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812700/extras/a6e6d09451c65be8ce187a849ff2d1be.avif?t=1763416794\" width=130 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stay human, Corinne needs to\u00a0<i>talk to others,</i> something she\u00a0<i>really</i> isn't good at. She'd rather just stay inside her apartment, where it's safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812700/extras/d1d07e69643861dac158019718f31105.avif?t=1763416794\" width=144 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But to survive, she'll need to <strong>escape</strong> from monsters, <strong>crawl</strong> into vents, <strong>dig</strong> into the rotten and frozen underbelly of the building, <strong>decipher</strong> cursed artifacts, and even <strong>travel through time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812700/extras/ce8efb1dd6a31fbb9f697ab722a1bcda.avif?t=1763416794\" width=200 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by horror games such as <strong>Ib</strong> and <strong>Pathologic,</strong> emotional survival takes a central focus in <strong>Corinne.</strong> Having the biggest gun is less important than deciding whether you'd pull the trigger <strong>if your best friend becomes a monster.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812700/extras/cf7669d1dbb23ed064a56b13092b6ce7.avif?t=1763416794\" width=154 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Corinne and the other residents make it out alive? That's entirely up to <strong>you</strong> and your ability to guide Corinne safely through this <strong>world of horrors.</strong></p>","developers":["Team Corinne"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812700/58e13d27a9531007d2f03094377a833eb1304b56/header.jpg?t=1763416794","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3812700/1848004772/e6f0912f8182412348df71dfe5318e7f115b61a9/1756153178/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756569364","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3812700/1848004772/e6f0912f8182412348df71dfe5318e7f115b61a9/1756153178/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756569364","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3812700/1848004772/e6f0912f8182412348df71dfe5318e7f115b61a9/1756153178/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756569364","id":257188768,"name":"Announce","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257188768/361bbd78c29c51c0f183f9ce6e48901a3e899028/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756569364"}],"name":"CORINNE","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8.1/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core I3